<SPT><TTL>Wall Mounted Components</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide wall tracks when components are shown attached directly to wall surfaces.  Provide tracks of heavy duty 
extruded metal with finish and color matching the the panel trim. Provide vertically aligned tracks slotted on<MET>
 25 mm</MET><ENG> 1 inch</ENG> centers in heights required that match slot spacing for components. </TXT><BRK/>
