<SPT><TTL>CPU Holder</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide a mounting to support the computer hard drive.  Desk top and floor locations are not acceptable.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Signage</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide [panel mounted][_____] signage composed, at a minimum, of aluminum frame, back panel, clear plastic cover, 
and hanging device.  Provide signage approximately[<MET> 76 by 203 mm</MET><ENG> 3 by 8 inches</ENG>][_____] and capable of receiving 
a replaceable [standard white][_____] paper insert.  Match [_____]text type.[  Include name of occupant on signage 
for each workstation with names provided by customer prior to installation [_____].][  Provide software for creating 
